# Pulse Flow design (mandatory)

Before any visual, UX, colour, typography, motion, or component change:

1. Read and follow [`docs/DESIGN.md`](docs/DESIGN.md).
2. Use tokens in `packages/pulse-tokens/` (`--pf-*` and the Tailwind `pf-` theme). Do not invent colours, radii, shadows, or fonts.

## Hard constraints

- Orange is `#F26A36` from the logo SVG. One orange tile or one orange button per screen. Orange button labels are white. The Order button is navy `#3D4F8A` with a white label. Do not put navy text on orange.
- Ink is navy `#0B1F5C`. Page is cool white `#F5F7FC`. No cream, no terracotta, no decorative gradients.
- Type is Onest, with Noto Sans Thai for Thai. Headlines 700 or 800. Native tab bars and nav titles use the system font.
- Radii stay in their roles: 28 hero, 20 card, 14 inputs, pill for buttons and tags.
- In dark mode, a selected row is an orange tint on the dark card with light text. Do not use peach `#FFE6D6` under light text.
- The property-ops app already uses these tokens. Follow this file for later visual changes.

If a request conflicts with DESIGN.md, follow DESIGN.md and note the conflict briefly.
